{"ID":"20240314091804-jve2mmw","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091804-jve2mmw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091804-jve2mmw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171131-n96s5sd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171204-picxk7c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:252,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171204-14rtriw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"【枳实芍药散】\u0026amp;【下瘀血汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171204"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171131-n96s5sd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171131-n96s5sd","updated":"20240422171131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产后腹痛，烦满不得卧，枳实芍药散主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171131-s6zk46d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171131-s6zk46d","updated":"20240422171131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实芍药散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171131-ph1vdhl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171131-ph1vdhl","updated":"20240422171131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实烧令黑勿太过、芍药各等分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171131-6ffzazf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171131-6ffzazf","updated":"20240422171131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右二味，杵为散，服方寸匕，日三服，并主痈脓，大麦粥下之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171131-vxq2arf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171131-vxq2arf","updated":"20240422171131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那有一种呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"产后腹痛"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生完小孩子肚子痛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"烦满不得卧"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，当你出现烦满不得卧的时候，可能生完小孩子宫里面呢，有一些残渣停留在里面没有排出来。大家看这个枳实芍药散，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实呢，能够去浊物，浊流，浊水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以你不要把枳实设定在小承气，大承气汤里面啊，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"能够宽肠，还有那个薤白枳实，胸痞病脉证，能够去那个心痛彻背，背痛彻心"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不要这样子设定它，枳实呢，只要有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"身上有浊水，肮脏的阳水啊，或者什么东西在子宫里面还没有排出来，我们加枳实跟芍药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171131-mjl8shf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171131-mjl8shf","updated":"20240422171131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以枳实呢烧黑啊，芍药两个等量...我们排脓汤里面就有枳实，对不对？所以说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人生完小孩以后，有腹痛的时候，太太会有这种现象，她就不能睡觉，情绪也不好，你就知道那边子宫里面还有脏东西没有出去，这个时候你用这两味药就可以了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，用粉剂。所以你看条辩的处方里面，说这两个呢（枳实、芍药）把它打成散，一次吃一个茶匙，一天吃三次，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"并主臃脓"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有没有，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"化脓也可以用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171131-s6qflfw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171131-s6qflfw","updated":"20240422171131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大麦粥下之"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，大麦粥配合这个来吃的时候，你可以把肚子里面的，肠子里面的浊物统统清出来，所以这是产后用的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171204-2g1t122","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171204-2g1t122"}},{"ID":"20240422171204-fs167ec","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171204-fs167ec","updated":"20240422171204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"师曰：产妇腹痛，法当以枳实芍药散。假令不愈者，此为腹中有瘀血着脐下，宜下瘀血汤主之。亦主经水不利。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171204-14rtriw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171204-14rtriw","updated":"20240422171204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"下瘀血汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171204-ahoe6ve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171204-ahoe6ve","updated":"20240422171204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄一两桃仁三十个蟅虫二十枚去足熬按：此即地鳖虫"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171204-2nwno8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171204-2nwno8i","updated":"20240422171204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味末之，炼蜜和为四丸，以酒一升煑丸，取八合顿服之，新血下如豚肝。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171204-g7bjb9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171204-g7bjb9q","updated":"20240422171204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"继续下来讲，这个下淤血汤呢，就是比较强的汤剂，它如果说继续演进的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人呢生完小孩以后肚子很痛，你用枳实芍药散就好了，结果给她吃了以后病没有好，代表这个药不够力量，也是代表这个太太呢，肚子里面有淤血没有排掉，这个要下淤血汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171204-l7hvhbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171204-l7hvhbd","updated":"20240422171204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中药的好处呢，不单单是治病，当你心里知道你在做什么..."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当个医生呢，一定要知道你在做什么，你对你的药很了解了以后，病人吃下的反应，你就可以用这种反应来判断里面是发生什么事情了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，比如说，我们开了大柴胡汤，吃下去大便还没出来，我们很明确的知道这个人是大柴胡汤证，开了大柴胡汤吃下去还没出来，证明这个已经大肠癌了，肿块很大，堵到肠子了，不然怎么可能不出来？了解我意思吧，诸如此类的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以你对你的处方很了解，你开的方剂很对症的时候哦，同时你的方剂可以帮助你做更准确的诊断"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你看这里，枳实芍药散没有办法把刚生完小孩的这个太太的腹痛去掉的话，就代表里面有很严重的淤血。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171204-r0agfai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171204-r0agfai","updated":"20240422171204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"下淤血汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，诸位看这个方子，有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄，桃仁，蟅虫"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，蟅虫是地鳖虫，那我们在使用的时候，一般蟅虫你到药房去买，买不到这种虫类的东西。那你可以用一些植物类的药，比如"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三菱，三菱莪术"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢这个药不单单是可以下淤血，你想打胎...正常的胎儿，健康的胎儿哦，你说我不想要了，能打下来！当然要一个月以内最好，你不要等到五六个月的时候打，打不下来了哦，太大了。那刚怀孕的一个月以内或者是两个礼拜以内，打胎效果越早越好。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个三菱莪术呢，打胎的力量都很强，因为只是个淤血当然可以打的出来啊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！"}]},{"ID":"20240422171204-mmf0y01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171204-mmf0y01","updated":"20240422171204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们攻瘀的时候，要确定，一般来说有瘀血在里面，都是有寒在里面，所以说你如果加了炮附子，炮附子三钱，炮附子能温下焦的阳，下焦阳虚的时候用炮附子。你一加热，这个肝血就会动了嘛，瘀血也会动，动了以后，你就用活血化瘀的药把它清出来，同时呢你用大黄，桃仁...你可以加丹皮呀，川芎啊，诸如此类的，都可以使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171204-picxk7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171204-picxk7c","updated":"20240422171204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般市面上现在找不到下瘀血血汤，哦。"}]}]}